{"articleNo":"238441","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=238441&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[장학] [근로][선발완료]2020-1학기 방학 중 계절학기 기간 국가근로장학생 모집 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2020.06.24","hit":"9458","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">- 2020-1학기 방학 중 계절학기 기간 국가근로장학생 모집 안내 -</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><br></span></p><div class=\"view_content\" id=\"view_content\"><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><br></span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\">- <strong><span style=\"color: rgb(239, 0, 124);\">2020-1학기 국가근로 자격을 갖춘(한국장학재단 국가근로 신청 후 승인완료</span><span style=\"color: rgb(239, 0, 124);\">, 성적 등의 기준 충족자)&nbsp;재학생만 해당됨을 알려드립니다.</span></strong></span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(239, 0, 124);\"><strong>- 하루 4시간 근무 가능한 학생 </strong></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\">- <strong><span style=\"color: rgb(239, 0, 124);\">성실하게 근무할 학생 </span></strong></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(239, 0, 124);\">- 방학 중 근무자 중복불가</span></strong></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\">- 선착순 선발 아닙니다. 신청기간 후 선발기준에 따라 선발합니다.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\">- 신청인원이 8명 이하인 경우 신청기간을 연장할 수 있습니다.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\">​</span></span></span></span></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><strong>1. 근무기간</strong> : <strong><strong>2020.7.6.(월)~7.24.(금) [계절학기 기간]</strong></strong></span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><strong><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">2. 근로지 내역 : 학생처 학생지원팀</span></strong></strong></span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; -&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rg